# @feature sponsor_time_window
# @purpose Brainfuck-owned unsigned 63-bit playback window validation start <= current < end; no host-supplied window-valid Boolean.
# @abi bfc_call_v1
# @fuel 2000000
# @inputs 24 bytes: little-endian 64-bit unsigned start, current, end. Host must attest all three values are nonnegative signed longs, same player generation and timeline.
# @outputs TIME_WINDOW_VALID (06) if start <= current < end; PASS (00) otherwise.
# @cells 0..23 timestamps; 40..47 saved current; 56 copy scratch; 64..76 quotient/remainder/comparison scratch; 77 lesser; 100..102 decisions.
# @invariant compare bits from lowest to highest significance; each more-significant differing bit overwrites the lesser flag. Division-by-two and Boolean updates are executable Brainfuck.
# @safety host must bind timestamps to same actual playback generation, verify signed-long bounds and separately validate any seek; this program itself does not seek.
# @section timestamp_window
